questions.stem:
A workstation restricts what may run by matching the path of an executable. The rule is written for this course and is shown in full.

```
policy {
  allow_if { path == "C:\\Program Files\\Vendor\\agent.exe" }
  deny_by_default
}
```

Users create their own profiles and may install software into them. What is wrong with the rule as the estate's main restriction?
